Which of the following statements is true?;Some societies emphasize either ascribed or achieved statuses and demphasize the other.;Laws making it a crime to hire relatives would most likely be enacted in societies that emphasize ascribed statuses over achieved ones.;Membership in an Indian caste is an achieved status.;None of the above
In the Indian caste system, which of the following is the highest ranking one?;Brahman;Kshatriya;Vaishya;Shudras
