Which of the following statements is true of castes?;They exist in many countries of the world.;They exist in many countries of the world.;They exist in India and Europe but not in North America.;They exist only in India.;They exist only in Central-Africa
When a society has distinct identifiable groups of people of similar age and usually of the same gender who share a common identity and maintain close ties throughout their lives, the groups are referred to as ____ .;age sets;age grades;age groups;age pyramid
While age sets are found throughout the world, they are most commonly emphasized in what part of the World?;sub-Saharan Africa;East Asia;North America and Europe;South America
The Masai cattle herders of Kenya and Tanzania strongly differentiate three major age-based groups--boys, warriors, and elders. Moran is their name for which of these three age-groups?;warriors;boys;elders;none